# The pre-WebP source images, kept locally in case a higher-resolution
# original is ever needed again. Ignored rather than committed: the site
# serves the .webp conversions and these are ~125MB of duplicate bytes.
#
# They are still in git history — `git log --all -- public/images/...` finds
# the commit that last held one, and `git checkout <commit> -- <path>`
# restores it — so ignoring them here loses nothing permanently.
legacy-images
